# Research Assistant

A Streamlit-based AI research agent. Given a question, it searches the web and Wikipedia,
synthesizes a structured report (topic, summary, full report, sources, tools used), and lets
you export it as Markdown, Word, or PDF. Built on LangChain with Google Gemini as the primary
model and an automatic Groq fallback chain for resilience.

